At the party is a new friend, Jane Wilde - there is a
strong attraction between the two.

6
00:23:28,695 --> 00:23:34,695
Jane is intrigued by Stephen's talk of stars and the Universe.

7
00:27:23,478 --> 00:27:29,478
But she realises that there is something very wrong when Stephen
suddenly finds that he is unable to stand up.

